§ `ss 3, 11(2), 13(2), 73`

#ASSERT `the instrument is a cheque` `a personal cheque to a named payee`
#ASSERT `the instrument is a cheque` `an undated cheque`
#ASSERT `the instrument is a cheque` `a post-dated cheque`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument is a cheque` `an order on a bank to pay out of the sales proceeds only`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument is a cheque` `an order on a bank to pay when the payee marries`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument is a cheque` `an unsigned cheque`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument is a cheque` `a trade bill on a company at 90 days after sight`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument is a cheque` `an order on a bank payable 30 days after date`

#ASSERT `the instrument is a bill of exchange` `a trade bill on a company at 90 days after sight`
#ASSERT `the instrument is a bill of exchange` `an order on a bank payable 30 days after date`

